  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Circo Hub Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment supports the setup and rollout of a CIRCO Hub in Bangladesh.The main objective is to create a functioning CIRCO Hub in Bangladesh that supports Bangladeshi companies to become more circular by designing and scaling up circular products and services.The Hub will organise design-based circular economy tracks, awareness sessions, and workshops. These activities will help Bangladeshi companies reduce waste and material use, improve supply chains, and develop sustainable business models.The aim is to empower the Hub towards independence, activate companies to join, apply the design methodology for companies and designers, and run a circular community driving a circular transition.</narrative>
  </description>
